          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"1-why-this-task\">1. Why this task?</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Property</th>\n<th>Value</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Env / task id</td>\n<td><code>iron_ore_throughput</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Goal</td>\n<td>Automate <strong>16 iron ore / 60 in-game seconds</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Why easiest</td>\n<td>Mining only \u2014 no smelting, assemblers, or oil</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Agents</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Typical horizon</td>\n<td>64 programs (lab-play default)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Harder tasks reuse the <strong>same loop</strong>; they mainly deepen the recipe tree.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
