          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"3-connect-to-factorio\">3. Connect to Factorio</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Prerequisites:</span>\n<div class=\"language-bash codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>uv<span class=\"w\"> </span>run<span class=\"w\"> </span>fle<span class=\"w\"> </span>cluster<span class=\"w\"> </span>start<span class=\"w\"> </span>-n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"m\">1</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># wait until RCON is up \u2014 see docs/SETUP.md</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Click <strong>Connect &amp; reset</strong> once. Re-clicking closes the previous session and\nopens a fresh one.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
