          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"4-action-one-python-program\">4. Action = one Python program</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Each <code>step</code> sends an <code>Action</code> with:</span>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Field</th>\n<th>Meaning</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>code</code></td>\n<td>Executable FLE Python (the whole \u201cmove\u201d)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>agent_idx</code></td>\n<td><code>0</code> for this task</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>game_state</code></td>\n<td>Helpers usually pass the current state</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Good:</strong></span>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">nearest</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Resource</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">IronOre</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">move_to</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">iron</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">place_entity</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">entity</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">Prototype</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">BurnerMiningDrill</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">position</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">iron</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">direction</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">Direction</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">NORTH</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">insert_item</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Prototype</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Coal</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">drill</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">quantity</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Bad</strong> (crashes inside FLE):</span>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">nearest</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;iron-ore&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">move_to</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">pos</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">iron</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">place_entity</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;mining-drill&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"o\">...</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Edit the program below, then <strong>Run program</strong>. Start with the explore\nsnippet from the guide (find iron, print it).</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
