            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"6-suggested-next-programs\">6. Suggested next programs</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Paste these into the editor one at a time (same policy as\n<code>examples/03_scripted_miner.py</code>):</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>A \u2014 move + place drill</strong></span>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">iron</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nearest</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Resource</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">IronOre</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">move_to</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">iron</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">drill</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">place_entity</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">entity</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">Prototype</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">BurnerMiningDrill</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">position</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">iron</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">direction</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">Direction</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">NORTH</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">drill</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>B \u2014 fuel it</strong></span>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">entities</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">get_entities</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">entities</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">drill</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nb\">next</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"n\">e</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">e</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">entities</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">name</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;burner-mining-drill&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">drill</span> <span class=\"ow\">is</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">insert_item</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Prototype</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Coal</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">drill</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">quantity</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">drill</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">inspect_inventory</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">You\u2019re \u201cdone\u201d on this task when a <strong>fueled</strong> miner sits on ore, ore has\nsomewhere to go (chest/belts), and measured rate \u2265 <strong>16 / 60s</strong>\n(<code>terminated=True</code>).</span></span>"
