            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"7-friction-cheat-sheet\">7. Friction cheat sheet</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Symptom</th>\n<th>Likely cause</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>missing run_idx</code></td>\n<td>Use <code>make_env(...)</code> (this notebook does)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hang on connect</td>\n<td>Cluster not ready \u2014 <a href=\"../../docs/SETUP.md\">SETUP.md</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weird <code>AttributeError</code></td>\n<td>Strings instead of <code>Resource.*</code> / <code>Prototype.*</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>unexpected keyword argument 'pos'</code></td>\n<td>Use <code>move_to(iron)</code>, not <code>move_to(pos=...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Always <code>reward=0</code></td>\n<td>No automated mining, or no fuel / output buffer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Program \u201cfailed\u201d but process OK</td>\n<td>Read <code>raw_text</code> \u2014 errors are observations</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"where-next\">Where next</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Scripted baseline: <code>uv run python examples/03_scripted_miner.py</code></li>\n<li>Maps: <a href=\"../../docs/VISUALIZATION.md\">VISUALIZATION.md</a></li>\n<li>LLM loop: <code>uv run python examples/04_dspy_agent_loop.py --steps 5</code></li>\n<li>Design loops: <a href=\"../../docs/SCENARIOS.md\">SCENARIOS.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Bottom line:</strong> this env is the smallest complete FLE contract \u2014\n<strong>goal, kit, program-in / text-out, throughput score</strong>.</span></span>"
